 ---
 
+## App SDK contracts
+
+PlantGuide publishes machine-readable contracts for the stable Python app SDK in `plantguide.integrations.sdk`:
+
+- `schemas/identify-response.schema.json` — payload returned by `assess_for_app()`.
+- `schemas/care-response.schema.json` — care-card payload returned by `care_card_for_species()` and `care_for_app()`.
+- `sdk/typescript/index.ts` — TypeScript request/response interfaces for app integrations.
+
+The schemas use JSON Schema Draft 2020-12. `integration_version` identifies the SDK contract generation; optional sample/image fields remain additive. The TypeScript contracts mirror nullable catalog identity fields emitted by the Python code.
+
+---
